Signed-off-by: Mehdi Djait <mehdi.djait@bootlin.com>
[revised description]
Reviewed-by: Rob Herring (Arm) <robh@kernel.org>
Signed-off-by: Michael Riesch <michael.riesch@wolfvision.net>
